            ],
            [
              "`Params<F>`",
              "`() => 0`",
              "[]"
            ],
            [
              "`Params<F>`",
              "`number`",
              "never"
            ]
          ],
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Rest `...a` captures **all** args as one tuple",
