      "page_title": "Mapped Types",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "☆ 1. What is it?",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Mapped type== builds a new type by looping over keys",
            "Syntax: `{ [K in keyof T]: T[K] }`",
            "`keyof T` form is ==homomorphic==: keeps `readonly` and `?`",
            "Loop over a literal union to make an object type"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "type Flags = {",
            "  [K in 'a' | 'b']: number",
            "};",
            "// { a: number; b: number }"
          ],
          "note": "no T needed, only a key union"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "☆ 2. Modifiers",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Modifier",
            "Effect"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "`+readonly`",
              "add readonly"
            ],
            [
              "`-readonly`",
              "remove readonly"
            ],
            [
              "`+?`",
              "make key optional"
            ],
            [
              "`-?`",
              "**required** again"
            ]
          ],
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "type Mutable<T> = {",
            "  -readonly [K in keyof T]: T[K]",
            "};",
            "type Req<T> = {",
            "  [K in keyof T]-?: T[K]",
            "};"
          ],
          "note": "`-?` strips undefined from optionals"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "☆ 3. Values, remap, filter",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "type Async<T> = {",
            "  [K in keyof T]: Promise<T[K]>",
            "};",
            "type Getters<T> = {",
            "  [K in keyof T as",
            "    `get${Capitalize<K & string>}`]:",
            "    () => T[K]",
            "};"
          ],
          "note": "`as` needs TS 4.1 or later"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "type Data<T> = {",
            "  [K in keyof T as",
            "    T[K] extends Function",
            "      ? never : K]: T[K]",
            "};"
          ],
          "note": "key remapped to never is dropped"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Input",
            "Mapper",
            "Result"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "`{id:1}`",
              "Async",
              "`{id: Promise<number>}`"
            ],
            [
              "`{name:1}`",
              "Getters",
              "`{getName: () => number}`"
            ],
            [
              "`{x:1; f(){}}`",
              "Data",
              "`{x: number}`"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "ts",
          "lines": [
            "type DeepPartial<T> = {",
            "  [K in keyof T]?: DeepPartial<T[K]>",
            "};"
          ],
          "note": "one level only without recursion"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Index signature `[k: string]` cannot take a key union",
            "`Record<keyof T, V>` loses `readonly` and `?`",
            "`Partial<T>` stays shallow: nested fields stay required"
